# Project memory

Before changing this repo, load context from `docs/memory/`:

- Architecture & dual pipelines → `docs/memory/architecture.md`
- Scanner protocol / contracts → `docs/memory/protocols.md`
- Deletion safety → `docs/memory/safety.md`
- Conventions → `docs/memory/conventions.md`

Short brief: `AGENTS.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- Every filesystem delete goes through `PathGuard` / `CleanupSafetyPolicy`.
- Smart Scan scanners implement `CleanupScanner` and register in `ScanCoordinator.standard`.
- Do not auto-select risky / dangerous / never-auto candidates.
- Prefer Trash (`moveToTrash`); refuse project-root deletes.
- After safety/detector edits run `./tests/run.sh`.
